<h2>Questions from Belleville owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Does my homeowners policy cover earthquakes?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Usually not, unless you added an earthquake endorsement. Those endorsements often carry a percentage deductible.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can brick be matched after a repair?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Sometimes. Salvaged or custom brick may be needed. If matching isn’t possible, the repair may need to extend to a full wall.</p></div></details></div>
